WEBVTT

00:13:29.640 --> 00:13:32.456
I assumed she meant community organizing

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:36.576
along the lines of what
President Obama did in Chicago.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:39.576
She meant organizing somebody's closet.

00:13:39.600 --> 00:13:41.016
I said, "I'm not doing that."

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:44.000
She said, "Get off your throne.
Money is green."

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:49.896
It's not easy being part
of the advance team

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:54.136
that is ushering in this new era
of work and living.

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:56.096
First is always hardest.

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:59.376
First is before there are networks

00:13:59.400 --> 00:14:02.776
and pathways and role models ...